      "Choosing a sunscreen"
    ],
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "This synthetic page describes broad spectrum sunscreen, SPF labels, and reapplying sunscreen after swimming. It mentions sun sensitivity, sunburn, and protective clothing in general terms. Its search keywords include alpha hydroxy acids, glycolic acid, retinol, and salicylic acid, although the page does not discuss those ingredients.",
