    "section_path": [
      "Synthetic guide to alpha hydroxy acids",
      "Sun sensitivity"
    ],
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "In this synthetic guide, topical use of cosmetics containing alpha hydroxy acids may increase skin sensitivity to the sun. The guide reports that this sensitivity may make sunburn more likely. It does not state how long the effect lasts for any individual.",
