      "Synthetic guide to alpha hydroxy acids",
      "Sun protection caution"
    ],
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "The synthetic guide advises people who use alpha hydroxy acid products to use sunscreen, wear protective clothing, and limit sun exposure while using the product and for a week afterward. However, the guide does not say that sunscreen removes every risk.",
