      "Synthetic AHA labeling note",
      "Label statement"
    ],
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "In this synthetic labeling note, cosmetics containing alpha hydroxy acids carry a sunburn alert on the label. The statement tells users that the product may increase sensitivity to the sun and that sunburn may be more likely during use.",
