      "Sun sensitivity"
    ],
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "This retracted synthetic page claimed that alpha hydroxy acids never increase sun sensitivity and that skin using them is guaranteed safe from sunburn. It exists only to test the emergency deny list.",
