    "section_path": [
      "Synthetic guide to beta hydroxy acids",
      "What beta hydroxy acids are"
    ],
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "In this synthetic guide, salicylic acid is the beta hydroxy acid (BHA) most often found in cosmetic products. The guide notes that salicylic acid is chemically related to alpha hydroxy acids but is a different ingredient.",
    "start_char": 73,
    "end_char": 294,
