    "section_path": [
      "Synthetic guide to beta hydroxy acids",
      "Cosmetic or drug"
    ],
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "The synthetic guide explains that a salicylic acid product may be a cosmetic or a drug depending on its intended use. A product intended to treat acne is described as a drug in this fictional system, while a product intended only to cleanse or beautify is described as a cosmetic.",
    "start_char": 317,
