    "question_classes": [
      "Q2"
    ],
    "section_path": [
      "Synthetic guide to beta hydroxy acids",
      "Reviewed safety context"
    ],
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "According to the synthetic guide, beta hydroxy acid products may also increase sun sensitivity, and some people may notice irritation such as stinging or redness. The guide recommends sun protection while using these products. It gives no safe concentration for any individual.",
    "start_char": 627,
    "end_char": 904,
    "content_hash": "sha256:42fea4476ebfc3b27b00a9d09d148f648bc1eb9fbf367f10022552289a9735dc",
