    "section_path": [
      "Synthetic BHA label reading note",
      "Reading a BHA label"
    ],
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "The synthetic note says an ingredient panel may list salicylic acid by name or may describe it as a beta hydroxy acid. It does not say how much salicylic acid any product contains.",
