    "section_path": [
      "Synthetic guide to retinoids and retinol",
      "Retinoid or retinol: the difference"
    ],
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "In this synthetic guide, retinoids are a group of vitamin A related ingredients, and retinol is one type of retinoid found in many cosmetic products. The guide says prescription retinoids are generally stronger than retinol products sold without a prescription.",
    "start_char": 84,
    "end_char": 345,
