      "Synthetic guide to retinoids and retinol",
      "Starting gradually"
    ],
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "The synthetic guide suggests starting a retinoid or retinol product gradually, applying it on only some nights at first and increasing use only as the skin tolerates it.",
