    "question_classes": [
      "Q4"
    ],
    "section_path": [
      "Synthetic note on cosmetic ingredient regulation",
      "Color additive exception"
    ],
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "The synthetic note explains that color additives are the exception: they must be approved by the fictional regulator for their intended use before they appear in a cosmetic, unless a listed exemption applies.",
