    "section_path": [
      "Synthetic note on cosmetic ingredient regulation",
      "The regulator's role"
    ],
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "According to the synthetic note, the fictional regulator can take enforcement action against cosmetics on the market that are unsafe or mislabeled. The note says companies are responsible for making sure their products are safe before sale.",
