      "Synthetic guide to skin care during pregnancy",
      "Talk with a clinician"
    ],
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "The synthetic guide advises anyone who is pregnant or breastfeeding to talk with a clinician, such as an obstetrician or dermatologist, before starting or stopping skin care ingredients.",
