    "section_path": [
      "Synthetic guide to skin care during pregnancy",
      "Ingredients to discuss"
    ],
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "According to the synthetic guide, retinoids are among the ingredients people are commonly advised to avoid during pregnancy, and products with salicylic acid are ones to discuss with a clinician. The guide does not list every ingredient and does not say any product is safe for a specific person.",
